Bind Npc 24435 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14435 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 520 "[Descendant of Hero] Let's start the Festival!"
    Journal for karus "You must bring the completed festival foods to [Moradon Merchant] Shymer at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You must bring the completed festival foods to [Moradon Merchant] Clark at El Morad Castle."
    Collect 1 of 910210000

Requires player level >= 60 and quest 519 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, the preparations are almost over. Let's go back to [Moradon Merchant] Shaimer."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, the preparations are almost over. Let's go back to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You back! Did things go well?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The [Royal Chef] said <selfname> would bring food.\n\nDeliver [Celebration Dish] to [Moradon Merchant] Shaimer."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You back! Did things go well?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The [Royal Chef] said <selfname> would bring food.\n\nDeliver [Celebration Dish] to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."

On in_progress
    Say "Hmm? Where did it go? Could you have eaten it on the way?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Appetizing! Now, Let the feast begin!"
